sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Home (Compose)
    participant C as ConnectionController
    participant V as ProxyFlowVpnService
    participant K as CredentialStore
    participant G as Engine (Go)
    participant O as Android
    U->>UI: Connect
    UI->>O: VpnService.prepare() (first time → B9 + system dialog)
    O-->>UI: granted
    UI->>C: connect(profileId)
    C->>K: decrypt password (Keystore)
    K-->>C: secret (in memory only)
    C->>V: startForegroundService (systemExempted)
    V->>G: preflight(profile) — TCP/TLS/auth handshake via protected socket
    alt pre-flight fails
        G-->>V: error code
        V-->>UI: B6b layout, not connected (nothing switched over)
    else pre-flight OK
        V->>O: Builder: addAddress 198.18.0.1/32 + fd00:66::1/128, routes 0.0.0.0/0 + ::/0, DNS 198.18.0.2, MTU, addDisallowedApplication(self), setUnderlyingNetworks
        O-->>V: TUN fd
        V->>G: start(fd, profile, limits)
        G-->>V: running · stats/events stream
        V-->>UI: Connected (B4) + notification (B10)
    end
    Note over V,G: Network change → setUnderlyingNetworks + engine.resetFlows() · proxy failures → Reconnecting (blocked)
    U->>UI: Disconnect
    UI->>C: disconnect()
    C->>G: stop() — closes flows, releases goroutines
    C->>V: close TUN fd, stopForeground, stopSelf
